/ The "Change" form in its Turbo Frame (transactions/_change_categories); opened on its own, a page around it.
- content_for :title, "Change categories · Transaction ##{@transaction.id} · Money Bin"

- unless turbo_frame_request?
  = render "ui/page_header", title: "Change categories", description: "Transaction ##{@transaction.id}" do
    = ui_link_button transaction_path(@transaction), variant: :ghost, size: :sm do
      = ui_icon "chevron-left"
      span Back to the transaction

= turbo_frame_tag dom_id(@transaction, :categories) do
  = render "transactions/categories_form", transaction: @transaction, filter: @filter, from_page: @from_page, standalone: !turbo_frame_request?
